<title>PHILIPPINES: EEI 1997 net seen up to 310 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>EEI 1997 net seen up to 310 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine construction and engineering firm EEI Corp said on Wednesday it expected its net income to increase to 310 million pesos this year compared with 264 million pesos last year.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the rise would come from new construction projects, merchandise sales and increased contributions from subsidiaries and affiliates.</p>
<p>EEI made a net income of 175.5 million pesos in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
